    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## STUDENTS BOOKING — HARDENED DEMO\nSame Google Form + group tabs + master sheet + waiting list + Telegram.\n\n**Important:** The original n8n write/read nodes are retained **disabled** at the bottom as a reference. The safe booking engine is Google Apps Script.",
        "height": 336,
        "width": 680,
        "color": 5
      },
