      "id": "3d5614a1-13b1-40d1-8e3a-c96ca23ab94c",
      "name": "NOTE 01 — SYSTEM"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 01 / INPUT & VALIDATION\nGoogle Sheets Trigger polls form responses.\n- Prepare Registration reads Arabic column labels including emoji.\n- Checks student name, gender, group, 11-digit phone.\n- `event_id` uses source row_number when present, otherwise deterministic timestamp+data fallback.\n- Only one active workflow should watch the demo sheet.",
        "height": 326,
        "width": 650,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "id": "ce1b2740-b8e7-4fef-9fa6-d5258a56a0d6",
      "name": "NOTE 02 — INPUT"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 02 / ATOMIC SEAT RESERVATION\n**SETUP REQUIRED:** Deploy `Booking_Engine_Google_Apps_Script.gs`, set Script Properties, then replace URL and token in HTTP node.\n- Apps Script LockService serializes booking requests through this web app.\n- Ledger preserves processing stage and supports replay/repair.\n- Checks group+gender settings and group capacity.\n- Writes confirmed to group + master, waitlisted to Waiting List.\n- No Wait nodes, no double settings output.",
        "height": 316,
        "width": 660,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1152,
        0
      ],
      "id": "943d0fa0-460b-4f6c-996d-6b059025919c",
      "name": "NOTE 03 — ENGINE"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 03 / NOTIFICATIONS\nCONFIRMED / WAITLISTED / DUPLICATE trigger one Telegram notification.\nALREADY_PROCESSED skips sending.\nINVALID / ERROR / RETRY sends an operations alert.\n\nTelegram sendMessage has no exactly-once key. The ledger records SENT/FAILED when result is known, but uncertain sends can still duplicate.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1840,
        0
      ],
      "id": "86c01d7f-25f6-49e2-8c81-ae4129c21e7f",
      "name": "NOTE 04 — DECISION"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 04 / ACCEPTANCE TESTS\n1. New student → 1 group + 1 master + 1 Telegram\n2. Same phone new form → duplicate, no extra rows\n3. Retry same event_id → ALREADY_PROCESSED\n4. Full group → one waiting row\n5. Two simultaneous last-seat requests → only one confirmed **when both use the Apps Script endpoint**\n6. Invalid settings/phone → rejected\n7. Simulate partial failure → retry same event_id and verify repair\n8. Fake data ONLY; inspect _BookingLedger.",
        "height": 350,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 2
      },
